                </div>
                <div class="text-center">
                    <img id="lostImagePreview" src="" class="w-24 h-24 rounded-xl object-cover mx-auto mb-2 border border-slate-200 hide bg-slate-100">
                    <label class="inline-block px-3 py-1.5 bg-slate-100 hover:bg-slate-200 text-slate-700 text-xs font-semibold rounded-xl cursor-pointer transition">
                        <i class="fa-solid fa-image mr-1"></i> แนบรูปภาพ (ถ้ามี)
